<title>NEW ZEALAND: Apple Fields yr loss narrows slightly.</title>
<headline>Apple Fields yr loss narrows slightly.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-12-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			     13.98 vs loss 14.59</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   47.8 vs 49.9</p>
<p>    Turnover			     19.29 vs 29.40</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			  13.81 vs 14.54</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   29.25 vs same</p>
<p>Apple Fields Ltd said the loss reflected another low payout for apples. Also contributing to the result was the anticipated reduction in the Corporate Division's earnings from the sale of investment properties. Directors have made a considered decision to further write down the orchard assets by NZ$8.42 million. The company is reviewing its land assets.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
